           IF DE-RS = SPACES
               MOVE "000" TO DE-RS.
           IF DE-RLSE = SPACES
               MOVE "000" TO DE-RLSE.
           IF DE-PRAPS = SPACES
               MOVE "000000" TO DE-PRAPS
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO DE-PO
               MOVE "000" TO DE-RS
                             DE-RLSE.
