049200         MOVE  66 TO LANG-MSGNUM
049300         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
049400         MOVE 27                        TO FIELD-NUMBER
049500         PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
049600         GO TO 6200-SHOW-FORM.
