065500             MOVE DE-PO-RLSE-RS            TO MSG-FLD
065600             MOVE 25                       TO FIELD-NUMBER
065700             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
065800             GO TO 6200-SHOW-FORM
065900         ELSE
066000             MOVE T TO TBL-LIMIT
066100             GO TO 6420-LSDX
066200     ELSE
066300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
066400         MOVE "DBGET ERR 6500-LATST" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
066500         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
066600
