067700*---------- ITEMS WERE MODIFIED PREVIOUSLY.  IF SO, THOSE ITEMS THAT WERE
067800*---------- PREVIOUSLY MODIFIED WILL BE SKIPPED.
067900     IF OK-AS-IS-SW = "Y"
068000         IF RCV-QTY-STORED > 0 OR RCV-DATE-STORED > SPACES
068100             GO TO 6410-LOAD-ALL-TO-SORT-TBL.
068200
068300     IF RCV-QTY-DLVR = 0
