080800*---------- LOOPED THRU WITH "SUB" AS A SUBSCRIPT.  FOR EACH ONE, THE ITEM
080900*---------- IN THE TABLE ARE LOOPED THRU WITH "T" AS A SUBSCRIPT.  IF THE
081000*---------- ITEM ON THE SCREEN DOESN'T HAVE A CORRESPONDING ITEM IN THE
081100*---------- TABLE, AN ERROR IS FLAGGED.
081200     MOVE ZEROES TO SUB.
