097500 6680-PUT-WINDOW.
097600     MOVE 20 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
097700     IF USER-WARNING-SW = "Y"
097800*        "WARNING - REC SLIP PREVIOUSLY MODIFIED"
097900         MOVE  23 TO LANG-SETNUM
098000         MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM
098100         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
098200     ELSE
098300     IF PREV-ACCEPTED-SW = "Y"
098400*        "WARNING - RECEIVING SLIP PREVIOUSLY ACCEPTED"
098500         MOVE  23 TO LANG-SETNUM
098600         MOVE  19 TO LANG-MSGNUM
098700         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
098800     ELSE
098900         MOVE SPACE  TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
099000
099100*    PERFORM 9040-PUTWINDOW.
099200
099300************************
099400**   WRITE TO DATA    **
099500**      BUFFER        **
099600************************
099700
099800 6690-PUT-BUFFER.
099900     MOVE 21 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
100000*    CALL "VPUTBUFFER" USING  VIEW-COMAREA,
100100*                           SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES, VIEW-DBUFLEN.
100200*    IF VIEW-STATUS NOT = 0
100300*        MOVE "VPUTBUFFER ERR 6690-PB" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
100400*        PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
100500*
100600********************************
100700*                              *
100800*       SHOW   FORM            *
100900*                              *
101000********************************
101100
           MOVE 0 TO DE-QTY (1), DE-QTY (2), DE-QTY (3), DE-QTY (4),
                     DE-QTY (5), DE-QTY (6), DE-QTY (7).
101200 6700-SHOW-FORM.
           IF PLT-NUMBER = "211" OR "281" OR "285"
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(88)
           ELSE
               MOVE B"0" TO IND(88)
           END-IF.
      *------4/28/97 IF CODE IS NOT FRANCHISED, DO NOT DISPLAY FRAN INFO
           IF STR-CODE-OWNER NOT = SPACES
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(95)
           ELSE
               MOVE B"0" TO IND(95).
101300     MOVE 22 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
101400*--- f2 f3 f6 INVALID, f1 f7 f8 APPLICATION, f4 REFRESH, f5 PRINT
101500     MOVE "I"                      TO   SRF-FKEY (2).
101600     MOVE 6                        TO   SRF-KEYSET.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE "ZUDCSTR" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
101700     CALL "TSHWRDFM" USING SRF-COMAREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
