101900       LANGUAGE-PARMS, SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES.
102000     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
102100         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
102200
102300*---------- F1 GIVES US THE MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY.  GOES DIRECTLY TO
102400*---------- THE CODE ON THE SCREEN.
102500*---------- NOTE - CODE ARG IS NOT USED BECAUSE "TMTLSTAT" WILL SPACE
102600*---------- IT OUT (RETURN BLANKS IN THE FIELD).
102700     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
102800*        CALL "VGETBUFFER" USING VIEW-COMAREA,
102900*          SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES, VIEW-DBUFLEN
103000         PERFORM 9020-OPEN-INQ-FORM THRU 9025-OIF-X
103100         MOVE CODE-ARG             TO   MTLSTAT-CODE-ARG
103200         CALL "TMTLSTAT" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, PLT-NUMBER,
103300           SRF-SPOOL-PRT-NO, MTLSTAT-CODE-ARG, LANGUAGE-PARMS
103400         PERFORM 9030-CLOSE-INQ-FORM THRU 9035-CIF-X
103500         MOVE MODSTRS              TO   VIEW-NFNAME
103600*        PERFORM 9070-GETNEXTFORM
103700*        CALL "VPUTBUFFER" USING VIEW-COMAREA,
103800*          SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES, VIEW-DBUFLEN
103900         GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM.
104000
104100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
104200         GO TO 6000-MAIN.
104300
104400     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8
104500         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
104600
104700 6730-GET-BUFFER.
104800     MOVE 23 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
104900*    CALL "VGETBUFFER" USING  VIEW-COMAREA,
105000*                      SCREEN-BUFFER-QUANTITIES, VIEW-DBUFLEN.
105100*    IF VIEW-STATUS NOT = 0
105200*        MOVE "VGETBUFFER ERR 6730-GB" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
105300*        PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
105400*
105500********************************
105600*  VALIDATE LOCATIONS & QTY,   *
105700*  CONVERT LOCATION QTYS TO STR*
105800*  UNIT OF MEASURE, AND        *
105900*  VALIDATE USER ENTERED UM.   *
106000********************************
106100
106200     MOVE ZERO TO SUB.
106300     MOVE ZERO                     TO   TAB-STORED-STR-UM (T),
106400                                        TAB-STORED-DLV-UM (T),
106500                                        SAVE-STORED-STR-UM,
106600                                        SAVE-STORED-STR-UM-DEC.
106700 6740-CHECK-LOC-QTY.
106800     MOVE 24 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
106900
107000*---------- AFTER ALL LOCATIONS HAVE BEEN CONVERTED TO STR UM AND ADDED
107100*---------- UP IN "SAVE-STORED-STR-UM-DEC" - 9(8)V(4), THE TOTAL MUST
107200*---------- BE ROUNDED TO A WHOLE NUMBER FOR ADDING TO ONHAND.
107300*---------- A DISCREPANCY CAN RESULT BETWEEN THE TOTAL ONHAND AND THE TOTA
107400*---------- OF THE LOCATION ONHANDS AS IN THE FOLLOWING EXAMPLE:
107500*----------      ONHAND = 0          LOC1    STORE .4
107600*----------                          LOC2    STORE .4
107700*---------- THE TOTAL STORED WILL BE .8 WHICH ROUNDS TO 1.  BUT EACH LOCAT
107800*---------- WILL STILL HAVE ZERO.  TO AVOID THE PROBLEM WE PLACE THE
107900*---------- DIFFERENCE INTO STOREROOM LOCATION 1.
108000     IF SUB < 7
108100         ADD 1 TO SUB
108200     ELSE
108300         MOVE ZEROES TO SUB
108400         ADD SAVE-STORED-STR-UM-DEC, 0 GIVING SAVE-QTY-1 ROUNDED
108500         MOVE SAVE-QTY-1           TO   TAB-STORED-STR-UM (T)
108600         IF SAVE-QTY-1 > SAVE-STORED-STR-UM
108700             SUBTRACT SAVE-STORED-STR-UM FROM SAVE-QTY-1
108800                 GIVING SAVE-QTY-2
108900             ADD SAVE-QTY-2 TO TAB-LOC-STORED-STR-UM (T, 1)
109000             GO TO 6770-CHECK-AMOUNT-STORED
109100         ELSE
109200             GO TO 6770-CHECK-AMOUNT-STORED.
109300
109400     IF DE-QTY (SUB) > ZEROS
109500         IF LOC (SUB) = SPACES
109600*            "CANNOT RECEIVE QTY IN NON-EXISTANT LOCATION"
109700             MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
109800             MOVE 141 TO LANG-MSGNUM
109900             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
110000             ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
110100             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
110200             GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM.

      *-------IF FRAN PO AND FRAN CODE
      *-------  MAKE SURE BIN IS THE PO FRANCHISE BIN,4/28/97
           IF SUB < 7
            IF DE-QTY (SUB) > ZEROS
             IF STR-CODE-OWNER = FRAN-PO-ID
              IF TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, SUB) NOT = FRAN-PO-ID
      *        PO FRANCHISE OWNED, BUT BIN IS NOT OWNED BY THE FRANCHISE
                   MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 176 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                   GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
              END-IF
             ELSE
              IF TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, SUB) NOT = SPACES
      *        PO FRANCHISE NOT CODE FRANCHISE, BIN MUST BE GOODYEAR BIN
                   MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 177 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                   GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
              END-IF.
110300
110400     IF LOC (7) > SPACES AND SUB < 7
110500         IF STR-LOC (SUB) = LOC (7)
110600*            "STOREROOM LOCATION ALREADY EXISTS"
110700             MOVE  19 TO LANG-SETNUM
110800             MOVE  33 TO LANG-MSGNUM
110900             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
111000             MOVE 20                     TO FIELD-NUMBER
111100             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
111200             GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM.
111300
111400     IF SUB = 7
111500         IF LOC (7) > SPACES  AND  DE-QTY (7) > ZEROS
111600           IF STR-LOC (1) = SPACES  OR
111700             STR-LOC (2) = SPACES  OR
111800             STR-LOC (3) = SPACES  OR
111900             STR-LOC (4) = SPACES  OR
112000             STR-LOC (5) = SPACES  OR
112100             STR-LOC (6) = SPACES
      *--------------4/28/97 EDIT NEW LOC FRANCHISE
                   IF LOC-FRAN(7) NOT = SPACES
                       PERFORM 9500-EDIT-FRAN THRU 9500-EDIT-FRAN-X
                       IF FRAN-FOUND = "N"
      *                "INVALID ID"
                           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
                           MOVE  19 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                           MOVE 40 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                           PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                           GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
                       ELSE
                         MOVE FRAN-ID(FRAN-IDX) TO TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, 7)
                         IF STR-CODE-OWNER = FRAN-PO-ID
                            IF TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, SUB) NOT = FRAN-PO-ID
      *        PO FRANCHISE OWNED, BUT BIN IS NOT OWNED BY THE FRANCHISE
                             MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                             MOVE 176 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                             ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
                             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                             GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
                            END-IF
                         ELSE
                            IF TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, SUB) NOT = SPACES
      *        PO FRANCHISE NOT CODE FRANCHISE, BIN MUST BE GOODYEAR BIN
                             MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                             MOVE 177 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                             ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
                             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                             GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
                            END-IF
                         END-IF
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
                   IF STR-CODE-OWNER = FRAN-PO-ID
                       IF TAB-LOC-FRAN(T, SUB) NOT = FRAN-PO-ID
      *        PO FRANCHISE OWNED, BUT BIN IS NOT OWNED BY THE FRANCHISE
                           MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                           MOVE 176 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                           ADD 21, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
                           PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
                           GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
112200             MOVE "Y"     TO TAB-ADD-LOC-SW (T)
112300             MOVE LOC (7) TO TAB-NEW-LOC (T)
112400           ELSE
112500*            "NO MORE STOREROOM LOCATIONS AVAILABLE"
112600             MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM
112700             MOVE  91 TO LANG-MSGNUM
112800             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
112900             MOVE 20                     TO FIELD-NUMBER
113000             PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
113100             GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM.
113200
113300*---------- CALCULATE THE ENTERED QUANTITES IN BOTH STR UM AND
113400*---------- DELIVERED UM, AND ADD UP TOTALS FOR EACH.
113500
113600     MOVE DE-QTY (SUB)             TO   UMCF-SOURCE-QTY.
113700     MOVE DE-UM (SUB)              TO   UMCF-SOURCE-UM.
113800     MOVE TAB-UM (T)               TO   UMCF-DEST-UM.
113900
114000     CALL "TUMCF" USING UMCF-RET-CODE, STR-UM-AREA,
114100       UMCF-QUANTITY-AREA.
114200     IF UMCF-RET-CODE = "NF"
114300*------- "QUANTITY UNIT OF MEASURE IS INVALID"
114400         MOVE  17 TO LANG-SETNUM
114500         MOVE  13 TO LANG-MSGNUM
114600         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
114700         ADD 28, SUB GIVING FIELD-NUMBER
114800         MOVE DE-UM (SUB)          TO   MSG-FLD
114900         PERFORM 4-SETERROR
115000         GO TO 6700-SHOW-FORM.
115100
115200*---------- THE QTY MUST BE ROUNDED TO NEAREST WHOLE NUMBER FOR
115300*---------- LOCATION ONHAND.
115400     ADD 0, UMCF-QTY-STR-UM-DEC
115500         GIVING TAB-LOC-STORED-STR-UM (T, SUB) ROUNDED.
115600
115700*---------- THE LOC QTY STORED (WHOLE) MUST BE ADDED UP TO CHECK
115800*---------- FOR A DISCREPANCY WITH TOTAL ONHAND.
115900     ADD TAB-LOC-STORED-STR-UM (T, SUB) TO SAVE-STORED-STR-UM.
116000
116100*---------- LATER, THE DECIMAL QUANTITY WILL BE ROUNDED TO A WHOLE NUMBER
116200*---------- FOR THE TOTAL NUMBER ADDED TO ONHAND
116300     ADD UMCF-QTY-STR-UM-DEC       TO   SAVE-STORED-STR-UM-DEC.
116400
116500*---------- EACH LOC QTY IS ADDED TO THE TOTAL STORED IN DELIVERD UM
116600     ADD UMCF-DEST-QTY, TAB-STORED-DLV-UM (T) GIVING
116700       TAB-STORED-DLV-UM (T) ROUNDED.
116800
116900     GO TO 6740-CHECK-LOC-QTY.
117000
117100********************************
117200*  MAKE SURE THE AMOUNT STORED *
117300*  DOES NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNT  *
117400*  DELIVERED.                  *
117500********************************
117600
117700 6770-CHECK-AMOUNT-STORED.
117800     MOVE 25 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
117900     ADD TAB-STORED-DLV-UM (T), TAB-PREV-STORED (T)
118000         GIVING CHECK-QTY.
118100
118200     IF CHECK-QTY > TAB-QTY-DLVR (T)
118300*        "OVER RECEIPT - CONTACT MATERIAL CONTROL"
118400         MOVE  15 TO LANG-SETNUM
118500         MOVE  21 TO LANG-MSGNUM
118600         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
118700         MOVE SPACES                 TO MSG-FLD
118800         MOVE 22                     TO FIELD-NUMBER
118900         PERFORM  4-SETERROR  THRU  4-SE-X
119000         GO TO  6700-SHOW-FORM.
119100
119200     GO TO 6630-WRITE-ITEM-TO-SCREEN.
119300
