120000*                              *
120100********************************
120200
120300 6800-NOW-PROCESSING.
120400     MOVE 26 TO SAVE-PARA-NUMBER.
120500     MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM.
120600     MOVE   2 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
120700     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
